4674	// seedCommitDriftAxis classifies a seed built on a different commit than this
4675	// worktree's HEAD. One git call — `rev-list --count --left-right A...B` — says
4676	// how far each side is from their merge base, which separates near-ancestor
4677	// drift (ok, with a built-from detail) from real distance or divergence
4678	// (stale). A comparison that cannot run keeps the stale verdict: an unreadable
4679	// history must not read as fresh.
